--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

llama.cpp — IdleToken distributes a modified version of this inference engine.
    The upstream commit is recorded in scripts/llamacpp-patches/UPSTREAM;
    IdleToken's modifications are maintained in scripts/llamacpp-patches/.
    Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors
    MIT License — full text in the upstream checkout's LICENSE and in
    licenses/llamacpp-MIT.txt inside the installers
    Upstream: https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp

Mbed TLS (v3.6.7) — the TLS implementation used by IdleToken's transport patch
    for the ggml RPC link. Not vendored here either: the patched llama.cpp
    build pulls it through CMake FetchContent and links it statically, so it is
    present in the llama-server and rpc-server executables shipped inside the
    installers.
    Copyright The Mbed TLS Contributors
    Apache License 2.0 — full text in the LICENSE file of the fetched source
    Upstream: https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls

NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit runtime — the Windows and Linux CUDA installers include
    the redistributable CUDA Runtime and cuBLAS dynamic libraries required by
    the bundled llama.cpp engine (cudart, cuBLAS and cuBLASLt). The NVIDIA
    display driver and its libcuda/driver DLL are not redistributed and must
    be supplied by the user's NVIDIA driver installation.
    Copyright (c) NVIDIA Corporation and affiliates
    NVIDIA Software License Agreement — full text is shipped in
    licenses/NVIDIA-CUDA-EULA.txt in CUDA-enabled installers
    Upstream: https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-toolkit

