Third-party components vendored in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

vendor/tweetnacl/ — TweetNaCl, "a crypto library in 100 tweets"
    Linked into idletoken-worker and idletoken-coord.
    Public domain, dedicated by D. J. Bernstein, Bernard van Gastel,
    Wesley Janssen, Tanja Lange, Peter Schwabe, Sjaak Smetsers.
    Upstream: https://tweetnacl.cr.yp.to/20140427/

vendor/blake2/ — BLAKE2b (RFC 7693), unkeyed one-shot subset
    Linked into idletoken-coord.
    Public domain / CC0, matching the upstream reference dedication by
    Samuel Neves and Jean-Philippe Aumasson.
    Upstream: https://github.com/BLAKE2/BLAKE2

